# Scraper-core (scholarmancy/scholaracle)

- Prefer editing `src/` over `dist/`; do not hand-edit generated build output.
- Reuse the extractors / recipes / transformers pattern already in the packages.
- Never launch a real Playwright browser or hit real school portals / Scholaracle APIs in tests — mock them.
